{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_nowell_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_nowell_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"當我們人生開始時","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_nowell_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4fa8abc57a4f38a6e5c0d7c5f57bb4a57480aa01aabaf9f05b914bb1a6deb28e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一名烏薩斯老人挾持了羅德島醫療點的幹員，聲稱自己是諾威爾的舊識。失去一切後被長生者救下的他，宣稱自己找到了能回報對方的辦法。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……您——請您冷……冷靜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經派人去找幹員諾威爾了！所以，也許現在您可以先把那根針，從她的太陽穴移——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在他出現之前，我不會動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你們最好也不要輕舉妄動，否則我不能保證那時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還能像現在這樣，很好地控制自己的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了，是誰，怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，你是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃爾洛奇卡先生，幹員諾威爾已經到了，請您先把針放下吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫埃爾洛奇卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不記得我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也對。我的模樣已經和我們上次見面時有很大變化，你認不出來也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我的確不記得你，但你說要找我，我來了。所以，我用自己來交換你手中的人質，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在要往前走了，你也可以慢慢放開小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人過來，在離我兩步的位置停下來，然後我會放開她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空手過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生，請小心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾將手中的施術單元和配鏡箱都放下，朝老人抬手示意，接著向前走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往前一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我照你說的做了。接下來，該你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，我言出必行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……離開倫蒂尼姆之後，我透過以前顧客的推薦，找到羅德島本艦，加入了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島是一家製藥公司，專精於研究與治療礦石病。他們在很多地方都設有辦事處和醫療點，這就是我再次出現在這片土地上的原因。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你還能治癒絕症？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴格意義上說，那不在我的職能範圍之內，我也沒有那樣的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你是個配鏡師。配鏡師算什麼醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，但掌握一些基礎的醫術和救援知識，就的確足以讓我從事廣義上的“救人”工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"一個費盡心力想死卻死不掉的人，開始把救人作為畢生事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，你肯定在跟我開玩笑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是玩笑，埃爾洛奇卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了很多，那你呢？你大費周章地找我，難道只是為了這樣敘敘舊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣，那就算先前你不用武器威脅那些小朋友，他們也會帶你來找我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你只是還和以前一樣衝動，一樣戲劇化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒希望用這個方法讓你立刻認出我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那邊，你們的人在收醫療帳篷。你們要搬走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在烏薩斯，治療礦石病的醫療點為什麼需要像巡迴馬戲團一樣隨時流動，你應該比我更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，礦石病、糾察隊、公民權利……老生常談，但這些都不是我要說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"知道你在這裡，我第一時間就趕過來了，卻只看到你們的人在收拾東西準備離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"入口那頂帳篷裡，只有剛才被我挾持的那個孩子在忙碌。她對我道歉，說現在暫時不收治病人，你們要搬去其他地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對。我本來應該跟她說清楚我不是病人，問她這裡有沒有一個叫“諾威爾”的人，能不能帶我去見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"但我等不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……難道你一直在找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，我言出必行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我讓開，讓我回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要和他們在一起，即便是死——也死在一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，你現在進去又有什麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓開，讓你走進火裡，和家人死在一起……最後誰也不會記得這裡發生過什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那也好過只有我一個人苟活！我不是那樣的懦夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是那個當事人。你不會不明白，究竟怎麼做才會讓你成為真正的懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們選錯了邊，就必定有人要承受後果。但如果“滅口”的行動來得比皇帝的敕令更早——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那在這場人為的慘劇之後，倖存者即使獲罪，最壞的下場也只是被流放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"什……你到底在說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說得已經夠明白了。他們犧牲了自己，為了保護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"保護我？呵……哈哈哈哈哈！保護我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是！肯定是你，是你殺了他們，是嗎？還說這是他們的選擇，為了保護我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……埃爾洛奇卡，這是你的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽好了，埃爾洛奇卡。我只是一名路過的配鏡師，甚至不是烏薩斯人，我從不打算主動介入你們的紛爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來還一個人情。你父親讓我救你，我做了，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我會相信你的狡辯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我以為你會更聰明一點。畢竟你看起來也不算年輕了，而衝動又戲劇化通常是年輕人的特權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈。我知道是你——一定是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"因為如果真的像你說的，你只是個小小的配鏡師，那你又怎麼會知道這麼多？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你本來就深入其中……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對。一定是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要殺了你！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的能做到，那我只會感謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火場中漆黑的煙灰已經沾染了烏薩斯青年的雙手。沒有多加思考，他舉起此刻身上唯一的武器，直直捅向眼前不為所動的男人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而匕首偏離了心臟，沒入男人肋下幾寸，似乎就被骨頭卡住，再也拔不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"——該死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你為什麼不躲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，如果你真的能殺死我，那這份解脫，甚至算得上是最好的生日禮物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管我已經忘記我的生日……太久太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道認為挑釁我就能讓自己的死相更好看一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定。我猜你只能繼續動手，試試看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"——哈——哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——咳！咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你就是不死？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳……呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，我試過，幾乎所有辦法。"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾吞下再度湧上喉頭的鮮血。他知道再過片刻，自己身上那些傷口就會奇蹟般地癒合。奇蹟，當然。\n於是在片刻的靜止後，他就伸手撐住自己，慢慢從雪地上爬起。\n疼痛仍在，只是從不留於表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過許多類似的悲劇，在維多利亞，在萊塔尼亞，甚至在高盧。而發生在你身上的，只是比那些場面乾淨一點的翻版。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要雪一直像這樣下著，便會掩埋所有骯髒的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴——閉嘴！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就快站不穩了，埃爾洛奇卡，所以與其浪費最後一點力氣，不如聽我說完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過這些，是因為我受到了詛咒。我會一直活下去，除非找到一樣我無論如何都不可能再擁有的東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的有這樣神奇的體質，那還有什麼東西是你找不到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我發誓，如果你是在跟我開玩笑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我來到這裡，也是為了走遍所有能去到的地方，尋找那個詛咒我的兇手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而我所見的越多，就越痛苦。這痛苦越龐大，我就離幸福、離死亡的解脫越遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不會說“至少你活下來了”這樣的話，這沒什麼好慶祝的。我只能告訴你，至少你還有選擇的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以選，是走進火場裡，還是用別的方法殺死自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，如果你仍然怪罪於我，想殺死我，那就活下去，然後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我尋找那個兇手一樣，來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不能……你不能走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你走了，我又要去哪裡才能找到你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要聽實話嗎？我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的只有給你一個信物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，我會來找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而這是你當時給我的信物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾看向老人手中的東西。\n一副眼鏡，鏡片已經破碎，一側的鏡架幾經修補，顯然受到了歲月無情的洗禮，而另一側的鏡架卻幾乎光潔如新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你還留著它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有沒有說過，我打造它的時候，是想用它來結束自己的性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，那時我沒有成功。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾接過眼鏡，將光潔如新的那支眼鏡腿從鏡架上抽出。\n兩個人都注視著那枚鑲嵌其中的尖銳長針。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有，但我可以想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們還說烏薩斯人都缺乏想像力呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想像已經是我們渡過某些悲慘境遇的唯一方法，那這片大地上的多數人都不會缺乏這種能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也對。只有想像，唯有想像……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你還打磨了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？我想至少應該不是為了用它去劫持一個什麼也不知道的年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找你，你知道這代表著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你言出必行，還是要殺死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"對，但也不完全對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確也到了胡言亂語的年紀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚自己在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃爾洛奇卡，你只能選擇殺我，或者不殺。生死不容曖昧地描述，也通常無法介於兩者之間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾把針插回眼鏡裡，交還給眼前遲暮的老人。\n老人短促地笑了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果我既是來殺你，也是來救你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我意識到，我幾乎不能因為那場悲劇而去仇恨任何具體的人……且對那背後更龐大的東西也無能為力呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經和這片大地擁有一些連繫，轉眼間卻又全部失去，甚至不能因此憎恨任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但你還是執著於尋找我，就像我曾經執著於……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"因為只有我活下來了，我看到困境，卻無能為力。我就這樣活著，卻不算真的活著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，是的，我理解了你。你曾經救了我，找到你的念頭又支撐我活到現在，所以我想，我應該報答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直活著，是因為曾受到讓我無法死去的詛咒。而你活下來，只因為你是一個頑強的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"頑強——哈，頑強！就讓我們當作是這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你離開之後，我被抓住，流放到礦場，卻幸運地在感染礦石病前被再次徵召入伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而在戰場上，我又一次次地與死亡擦肩而過，無數次成為那個“幸運的傢伙”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我就決定，一定要找到一種能殺死任何人的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你找到了，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我覺得我……找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人眼中閃著與年齡不符的光亮。他目光灼灼，抓住諾威爾的雙手，將一個玻璃瓶放到他手中。\n諾威爾只看到渾濁的液體在玻璃瓶裡晃蕩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的報答，諾威爾。不必再無望地尋找幸福，只需要喝下去就能使一切結束——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成我的復仇，你得到你的解脫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首字母順序……埃爾洛奇卡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！電子記錄壞了，還好有文字存檔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍用背包……麵包、水壺、兩本書、四枚勛章、一張照片……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰色外套裡有一副眼鏡和——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……兩個裝著液體的玻璃瓶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻璃瓶內容物呢？沒有當場監督他飲用或者開瓶檢查？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，沒有……沒有！他都能把麥稈那麼粗的針帶進來了，誰知道玻璃瓶裡會是什麼東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在和幹員諾威爾待在一起，諾威爾先生還沒帶他的施術單元，我要快點——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾——諾威爾先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她衝出去，卻只來得及看到老人向諾威爾用力揮出一拳，正中前胸。\n而諾威爾幾乎毫不避讓，被打得接連後退幾步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生！你沒事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？他為什麼要打你？而且，他有沒有拿出什麼奇怪的東西……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫療幹員的注意力轉向地面。那裡，一個玻璃瓶被砸破在雪地裡，液體的顏色很快消融，只留下一地碎片和一塊深色的印記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等她再抬頭，老人已經離開營地，身影消失在前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們發生了衝突？你有哪裡受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是敘舊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是你，面對這樣的誘惑也需要考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解，只是留給你我的時間不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是在想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要怎麼才能恰當地表達拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……你已經不再渴望死亡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天我都比前一天更期盼它的到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你沒理由拒絕，除非你也是個懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的品性從來跟勇敢兩字相距甚遠，但這也不是理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃爾洛奇卡，你知道能殺死我的只有幸福。就像非自願的長生一樣，這是由某種傲慢的、超自然的存在給我定下的規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，你宣稱用一瓶毒藥就可以打破它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那如果我告訴你，你現在將那根針取出來刺進我的太陽穴，或刺穿我的頸動脈，也可以達到同樣的效果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"什……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經不再是長生者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你想表達什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經見過了那個降下詛咒的傢伙，找到了能殺死我的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我站在這裡，做的這些救人的事……一切都與這個事實相關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你想告訴我，你既完成了復仇，還在這裡找到了幸福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"在這群做著治癒絕症的白日夢的人當中，找到了幸福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以這樣說，但重點是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重點是，死亡已經在向我走來的路上，埃爾洛奇卡。但如果你堅持要我現在就喝下這毒藥，我也會照做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"選擇權在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是在報答你，只是在殺死你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但發洩出來，你會好過很多。只是在醫療點搬離之前，我還有一副眼鏡沒有做完，是要給這裡的一個小女孩，他們都叫她卡佳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我做完眼鏡，喝下毒藥，或許你也可以幫我把眼鏡拿給她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會留下遺書表明是自殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，如果我會有葬禮，我希望你能來參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾，你認真的？你把我，一個無論動機如何都是來殺你的人，當成許願池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你當成一位難得的舊友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那恐怕你要失望了，因為我這個舊友什麼也不會為你做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人猛地從諾威爾手裡奪回玻璃瓶擲向地面，不給對方任何反應的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃爾洛奇卡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"都到這個時候了，我帶著毒藥來找你，你卻天殺的還想著要救我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"拯救我，寬慰我，幫助我，把自己置於這樣的位置能讓你感到幸福，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"但我偏不讓你心想事成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看清楚了，諾威爾。你救不了我，因為即將殺死我的不是疾病，也不是戰場上的流彈，而是無法阻擋的衰老——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果你說的都是真的，那你很快也會體會到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一句都是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說，反正我永遠不會知道答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，不是留給“我們”的時間不多了，而是……你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己時日無多了，是嗎？你急於找到我，也是因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"還要多謝你，讓我蹉跎半生，到最後卻報不了仇，也報不了恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，當然，你在你漫長的人生中一定也見過很多過得和我一樣荒謬的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是荒謬，埃爾洛奇卡。那只是痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦曾是我們在生活裡唯一能緊緊抓住的東西，真正荒謬的……是使人淪落至此的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承認痛苦存在並不可恥，如果我能幫助你——我還能為你做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼也做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要，我可以只用玻璃瓶的碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但說真的，我不明白。假如你不想讓我心想事成，那你更應該在這裡殺了我，不是嗎？以斷絕任何我出手救你的可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不，別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，救人是我如今的畢生事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，你站穩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你改變主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是，你給我站穩了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對，真正荒謬的不是我，所以我更不需要你的憐憫，諾威爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——諾威爾先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我們扯平了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生，諾威爾先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我剛才可能恍神了。你說了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下你需要去做個全面檢查，看看剛才那一拳有沒有傷到肋骨之類的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，還有小卡佳的眼鏡，是不是快做好了？我們明天早上就要搬去下一個城鎮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，今晚就能做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔細的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們先回帳篷裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你先去吧，我沒問題。你也知道，我受的傷通常很快就能恢復了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，謝謝你出來找我，只是現在我得收拾一下這些東西……這些玻璃碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免得因為它們都埋在雪裡，被其他人或者馱獸踩到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
